			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"**⚠️ 本工作流为展示版：请先从我们的 GitHub 下载精心微调后的完整节点包和工作流再使用**\nhttps://github.com/LynnReal-AI/LynnReal-Omni/tree/main/comfyui\n\n## LynnReal Standard · 4-step DMD (t2v)\n\nBuilt from the verified r2v graph with the conditioning node swapped.\n\n- `UNETLoader`: `lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors`\n- `BasicScheduler`: `simple`, **4 steps**, denoise 1\n- `KSamplerSelect`: `euler`\n- `MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo with no conditioning frame (text only)`\n- `ResolutionSelector`: 0.98 MP (1344x768), matching the reference script default\n\n**Precision — INT8 (optional)**\n\nThe **`Use INT8 model?`** switch above the loader (default **off**) swaps `UNETLoader` from\n`lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors` to `lynnreal_omni_standard_int8.safetensors`. Same\nW8A8 contract as the release's `--precision int8` path: per-output-channel weight scales,\nper-token activation scales, INT32 accumulate; block 0, the last block, the token refiner,\nadaLN and the IO projections stay BF16.\n\n**Links**\n\n- Code: https://github.com/LynnReal-AI/LynnReal-Omni\n- Paper: https://huggingface.co/papers/2609.15863\n- Weights: https://huggingface.co/stdstu123/LynnReal-Onmi-beta-0.1\n"
